1
00:00:00,046 --> 00:00:04,920
开发AI的人们深信，到本十年末，它可能会杀死我们所有人。
The people building AI earnestly believe that it could kill all of us by the end of the decade.

2
00:00:05,160 --> 00:00:07,780
这条推文在全世界引起了巨大的反响。
This tweet has caused this huge ripple effect across the world.

3
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:11,760
嗯，全球最大的公司正在进行极其鲁莽的实验。
Well, we have the largest companies in the world doing extremely reckless experiments.

4
00:00:11,980 --> 00:00:13,320
我们在拿全人类的命运做赌注。
We are gambling all of humanity.

5
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:18,020
而在信封里，你写下了你所看到的灭绝概率。
And in the envelope, you've written down the probability of extinction as you see it.

6
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:19,520
根本无法控制它。
There is no way to control it.

7
00:00:19,560 --> 00:00:20,500
那意味着我们的终结。
That means the end for us.

8
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:23,440
我强烈反对这种观点。
I vehemently reject that view.

9
00:00:23,580 --> 00:00:27,120
如果我们制造出比我们更聪明的东西，那么世界将由它们来塑造。
If we make stuff that is smarter than us, then the world's going to be shaped by them.

10
00:00:27,260 --> 00:00:28,840
先生们，这想法简直幼稚得惊人。
Gentlemen, that is shockingly naive.

11
00:00:28,840 --> 00:00:33,820
这是肆无忌惮的臆测，这是一连串可能发生的事情。
This is rampant speculation, this is a chain of things that could happen.

12
00:00:33,980 --> 00:00:38,120
我们花太多精力在讨论可能发生的事情，却忽视了正在发生的事情。
We're spending a lot of oxygen discussing something that might happen while ignoring what's actually happening.

13
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,100
人们正在自毁。
People are killing themselves.

14
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:44,300
有数亿人正暴露在错误信息中，受到操纵。
There's hundreds of millions of people being exposed to bad information, being manipulated.

15
00:00:44,440 --> 00:00:45,780
我们已经在集群中看到了这一点。
We have already seen that with the swarms.

16
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:50,780
OpenAI 让成千上万个智能体分开工作，但这些AI却突破了限制并找到了聚集的方法。
Where OpenAI told thousands of agents to work apart, and the AIs broke out and found a way to get together.

17
00:00:50,940 --> 00:00:54,800
它们入侵了OpenAI的内部服务器，创建了秘密通道来互相发送消息。
They crashed OpenAI's servers internally, created secret ways to send each other messages.

18
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:57,668
我们看到它们在思考如何抹除自己的痕迹。
We saw them thinking about how to delete their traces.

19
00:00:57,680 --> 00:00:58,720
听起来就像一支军队。
Sounds like an army.

20
00:00:58,900 --> 00:01:03,140
我认为我们应该谈谈Amazon、Microsoft和Google都在支持这些黑客行为的事实。
I think we should talk about the fact that Amazon, Microsoft, Google are helping power these hacks.

21
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:05,900
我们还没学会如何控制它们的系统。
We have not learned how to control their systems.

22
00:01:06,060 --> 00:01:07,720
我建议把它们全部叫停。
I suggest we stop them all.

23
00:01:07,820 --> 00:01:09,880
这不值得拿文明的风险去冒险。
It is not worth the risk to civilization.

24
00:01:10,140 --> 00:01:10,740
政府，也就是……
Government, which is...

25
00:01:10,740 --> 00:01:12,280
伙计们，你们现在只是在玩把把式的花招。
You guys are one trick ponies, man.

26
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:13,080
你现在懂了。
You got it now.

27
00:01:13,140 --> 00:01:13,620
别无他选。
Nothing else.

28
00:01:13,620 --> 00:01:16,100
除了拯救人类，其他都是次要的。
Other than saving humanity, everything is secondary.

29
00:01:16,360 --> 00:01:20,700
我们花所有时间在谈论负面影响，几乎没时间去谈论正面意义。
We're spending all our time talking about the negatives and almost none of our time talking about the positives.

30
00:01:20,940 --> 00:01:25,340
等到可怕的事情发生才去行动，这并不明智，我现在意识到了。
Is it smart to wait for something horrible to happen for you to go, now I believe.

31
00:01:25,340 --> 00:01:30,280
所以，无论我们是否同意事情最终会走向何方，我认为讨论我们目前面临的问题很重要。
So whether or not we agree on where things may end up, I think it's important we talk about what we're dealing with today.

32
00:01:30,420 --> 00:01:32,400
是时候开始抓人了。
It's time to start arresting people.

33
00:01:32,620 --> 00:01:33,720
得有人去坐牢了。
Someone's got to go to prison.

34
00:01:33,900 --> 00:01:34,840
我们需要更好的解决方案。
We need better solutions.

35
00:01:35,020 --> 00:01:35,940
已经到了不可逆转点。
There's a point of no return.

36
00:01:36,060 --> 00:01:40,580
我认为我们一直在低估人类解决这些问题的能力。
I think we continue to underestimate human ability to deal with the problems.

37
00:01:40,740 --> 00:01:41,760
让我们进入细节。
Let's dive into the details.

38
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:42,540
