If there was ever a time to deliver upon a favour for us, it would be right now.

45
00:02:09,508 --> 00:02:14,050
我保证我会竭尽全力，确保这个频道能不断变得更好。
And I promise that I will do everything in my power to make sure that this channel gets better and better and better for you.

46
00:02:14,830 --> 00:02:15,290
成交吗？
Do we have a deal?

47
