Jacob Coxon, who worked at both Anthropic, which owns Claude, and OpenAI, which
owns Chachapiti did a tweet which has sent the world into a bit of a tailspin.

48
00:02:28,790 --> 00:02:35,250
他在推特上说：构建 AI 的人们深信到本十年末，它可能会杀死我们所有人。
He tweeted saying, The people building AI earnestly believe that it could kill all of us by the end of the decade.

49
00:02:35,570 --> 00:02:36,690
这不是什么营销噱头。
This is not a marketing stunt.

50
00:02:36,830 --> 00:02:44,950
如果非要说的话，许多高管和资深研究员在媒体面前会
委婉些措辞以显得理智，但我听到同样的人表达出恐惧。
If anything, many executives and senior researchers will soften their phrasing
in the press to sound sensible, but I hear the same people express fear.

51
00:02:45,550 --> 00:02:50,370
这条推文随后被一位 Anthropic 的现任员工转发并评论道：Jacob 说得对。
That was then quote retweeted by a current Anthropic employee who said, Jacob is correct here.

52
00:02:50,606 --> 00:02:53,090
我们确实深信 AI 可能杀死所有人类。
We really do earnestly believe AI could kill all humans.

53
00:02:53,550 --> 00:02:56,830
就我个人而言，我认为在未来十年内有超过 10% 的概率。
I personally anything, it is a more than 10% chance within the next decade.

54
00:02:57,198 --> 00:03:05,130
我相信 Anthropic 正在尽力而为，但我们还没有解决超智能对齐的计划，
而且目前并没有明确的进展方向。
I believe Anthropic is trying its best, but we do not yet have a plan
to solve alignment for superintelligence, and are not clearly on track.

