只需要你们用一句话来回答，只是为了明确你们的立场。
So my first question to all of you is, as it relates to AI, and in this first
question I just want a one-sentence answer, just to frame your position.

60
00:03:36,170 --> 00:03:42,870
当考虑到目前围绕 AI 的讨论时，你脑海中浮现出的第一句话是什么？
