这取决于是否存在真正的灭绝风险。
You know, I think whether or not the issues of extinction are a distraction between, you know,
from the possible benefits or from some of the present harms, I think that comes down to whether there is a real extinction risk.

116
00:07:53,742 --> 00:07:57,670
