1513
01:42:40,622 --> 01:42:47,830
然后继续到：如果它们更聪明且拥有你不想看到的意图，为什么我们认为它们很可能会除掉我们？
And move on to like, if they are much smarter and have goals you don't want, why do we think they would likely kill us?

1514
01:42:49,330 --> 01:42:51,010
这两个点我都可以讲。
I'm sort of, I could go over either of those.

1515
01:42:51,110 --> 01:42:56,970
