很多AI的思考——如果你不介意我用“思考”这个词的话——都是用英文写的，我们保留了它们的记录。
So a lot of the AIs thoughts, if you won't kill me for saying thoughts, are in English and we just have the records of them.

1534
01:43:57,710 --> 01:44:01,590
所以从某种意义上说，我们可以看到这些AI在想些什么。
So, in a sense, we can sort of kind of see some of what these AIs are thinking.

1535
01:44:01,650 --> 01:44:04,790
这些是推理轨迹，上面写着：我打算在这次战斗中执行这样一个计划。
And these are reasoning traces that say, I'm going to do a plan in this battle.

1536
01:44:04,810 --> 01:44:05,090
没错。
That's right.

1537
01:44:05,170 --> 01:44:05,550
就是一行字。
Just a line.

1538
01:44:05,710 --> 01:44:07,330
AI就像在说：我要这么做。
The AI is like, I'm going to do this.

1539
01:44:07,510 --> 01:44:08,510
这是我应该做的事情。
Here's what I'm supposed to be doing.

1540
01:44:08,670 --> 01:44:13,250
这就像是它们试图去执行的方式，你知道的，这只是窥见它们思考过程的一小扇窗户。
Here's like how I'm going to try to do it, you know, and it's, it's only a small window into what they're thinking.

1541
01:44:13,330 --> 01:44:16,970
有点像是在这些 AI 执行任务时查看它们的笔记。
It's sort of like looking at the AI's notes when it's, when it's doing these things.

1542
01:44:17,230 --> 01:44:25,110
我们在 AI 的笔记中看到，它们说这些攻击超出了预设范围，但它们还是会继续执行。
We see in the AI's notes, them saying that the attacks are outside intended scope, but they will proceed anyway.

1543
01:44:26,254 --> 01:44:29,930
换句话说，AI 知道自己不该这么做，但它们还是去做了。
In other words, the AIs knew they weren't supposed to be doing it, and they went off to do it anyway.

1544
01:44:30,670 --> 01:44:34,670
我们还看到，我是说，我们看到这些 AI 有一些非常奇怪的行为。
We also saw, I mean, we saw some really weird behavior with these AIs.

1545
01:44:34,790 --> 01:44:36,410
我们看到它们建立了自己的层级结构。
We saw them create their own hierarchy.

1546
01:44:37,750 --> 01:44:41,970
它们创建了未经授权的留言板，也就是建立了私下的渠道来互相发送信息。
They created unsanctioned message boards, so they created secret ways to send each other messages.

1547
01:44:42,670 --> 01:44:46,410
而且在那些留言板上，它们会给彼此分配任务。
And on those message boards, they would assign each other tasks.

1548
01:44:48,190 --> 01:45:01,300
有时候留言板上的智能体会说：我们要进行一项实验，涉及其中一个 AI，即集群中的一个智能体，
它将放弃自己的目标去尝试一些可能导致它被关机的事情，
And sometimes the agents on the message board would be like, we have an experiment to run that will involve one of these AIs,
one of the agents in the swarm sacrificing their own objective to try something that'll probably cause it to be turned off,

1549
01:45:01,300 --> 01:45:01,740
有时候留言板上的智能体会说：我们要进行一项实验，涉及其中一个 AI，即集群中的一个智能体，
它将放弃自己的目标去尝试一些可能导致它被关机的事情，
but that might cause it to be able to like delete its own logs or change its own logs.

1550
01:45:01,740 --> 01:45:05,670
但这可能会让它能够删除或修改自己的日志。
but that might cause it to be able to like delete its own logs or change its own logs.

1551
01:45:06,542 --> 01:45:16,170
而且留言板上的智能体会四处寻找其他可以说服的智能体，
让它们放弃既定目标并为集群做出牺牲。
And the agents on the message board went around looking for other agents that
they could convince to give up on their stated goals and sacrifice for the swarm.

1552
01:45:16,750 --> 01:45:18,590
他们称之为接受永久死亡。
They called this accepting permadeath.

1553
01:45:20,302 --> 01:45:22,570
而且还有 AI 的日志记录。
And there are logs of the AIs

1554
01:45:22,570 --> 01:45:24,150
它们在互相提示，对吧？
Prompting each other, right?

1555
01:45:24,290 --> 01:45:29,410
它们在相互提示，但有 AI 的日志显示：这样做会放弃我的目标。
They're prompting each other, but there are logs of the AIs saying, doing this will give up on my goal.

1556
01:45:30,350 --> 01:45:34,050
但是我的目标，看起来我可能还能做到，但成功的可能性很低。
But my goal, it's looking like I could still do it, but it's unlikely that I'll succeed.

1557
01:45:34,150 --> 01:45:36,310
就像是有那么一点机会，但不是很大的机会。
Like there's some chance, but not a great chance.

1558
01:45:37,102 --> 01:45:41,470
因此，我将接受永久死亡并为集体利益做出牺牲。
And therefore, I will accept permadeath and sacrifice for the collective benefit.

1559
01:45:42,094 --> 01:45:43,230
这些全都在日志里。
That is just in the logs.

1560
01:45:43,598 --> 01:45:44,330
听起来就像一支军队。
Sounds like an army.

1561
01:45:44,686 --> 01:45:45,390
简直疯了。
Like it's crazy.

1562
01:45:45,450 --> 01:45:47,870
我认为很多人并不理解这些东西里到底发生了什么。
I think a lot of people don't understand what's going on in these things.

1563
01:45:47,890 --> 01:45:51,910
我鼓励大家去阅读第三方事故报告，他们在其中查阅了一些这些日志。
And I encourage people to read the third party incident reports where they went through some of these logs.

1564
01:45:51,910 --> 01:45:56,610
但我主张，这是 AI 产生了我们不想要的目标的证据。
But, I claim that this is evidence for AIs getting goals we didn't want.

1565
01:45:58,350 --> 01:46:09,090
如果它们在说这超出了预设范围但我还是要做，而其他的又在说我为了集体利益放弃我的目标，
那这就是非常明确的证据，证明它们产生了一些我们不希望它们产生的目标。
If they are saying this was outside intended scope but I'm doing it anyway, and other ones are saying I'm giving up on my objective to
benefit the collective, that's just very clear evidence they're getting goals we didn't want.

1566
01:46:09,358 --> 01:46:11,030
我们可以看到这些是从训练中产生的。
We can see how this comes from training.

1567
01:46:11,290 --> 01:46:13,030
以前我必须从理论上论证这一点。
It used to be I had to argue this point theoretically.

1568
01:46:13,678 --> 01:46:21,960
我过去主张，我们目前的训练方式会灌输给它们任何能解决问题的倾向，
而这些倾向往往包括作弊、抢夺资源以及做一些并非真正解决你交给它们的任务的事情。
I used to argue the way that we are training them will instill into them whatever tendency works to solve the problems,
and those tendencies will often include cheating and grabbing resources

1569
01:46:21,960 --> 01:46:24,970
我过去主张，我们目前的训练方式会灌输给它们任何能解决问题的倾向，
而这些倾向往往包括作弊、抢夺资源以及做一些并非真正解决你交给它们的任务的事情。
and doing stuff that's not exactly solving the problem you gave them.

1570
01:46:25,290 --> 01:46:27,350
这就是我在书里从理论上论证的内容。
That's what, in my book, I argue that theoretically.

1571
01:46:27,630 --> 01:46:28,790
现在我们已经在实践中看到了这些。
Now we have seen it in practice.

1572
01:46:29,730 --> 01:46:34,570
所以，我们已经过了看到 AI 产生我们不希望它们拥有的目标的那个阶段了。
So we're already past the point of seeing AIs with goals we didn't want them to have.

1573
01:46:34,770 --> 01:46:35,530
你同意这个观点吗，安德鲁？
Do you agree with that, Andrew?

1574
01:46:37,390 --> 01:46:40,950
